#---
# purpose: "public <> joins byte-aligned binaries across inline and ProcBin storage"
# oracle: oracle.exs
#---
#
# Exercises the public `<>` wrapper over the runtime binary-concat export. The small
# case stays inline; the long case crosses the shared-binary threshold and
# therefore returns through the ProcBin path.
def main() do
  small = "foo" <> "bar"
  long_left = "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
  long = long_left <> "bbbb"

  dbg(small)
  dbg(long)
  dbg(Utf8.valid?(long))
end
